        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-03T16:47:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I found, at least in a couple 2-spirit games, that Wildfire pairs well with Rampant Growth. &nbsp;(which actually makes a lot of sense if oyu think about it)</p><p>Rampant Growth really doesn't care too much about losing presence (unless there is a need to have a sacred site to prevent Invader actions in that particular land). &nbsp;And, rampant growth always gets at least 1 presence out each turn, regardless.</p>",
